WEBVTT

01:22.046 --> 01:22.796
JOJO'S BIZARRE ADVENTURE
DIAMOND IS UNBREAKABLE

01:22.797 --> 01:24.924
<i>A demon's crept into
our everyday life</i>

01:24.966 --> 01:27.301
<i>It's about to take away
something precious</i>

01:27.343 --> 01:30.596
<i>Our peace has already
crumbled long ago</i>

01:31.347 --> 01:33.474
<i>So casually, so nonchalantly</i>

01:33.516 --> 01:35.851
<i>It's taken from us
before we know it</i>

01:35.935 --> 01:39.188
<i>If we want it back,
now's the chance</i>

01:39.397 --> 01:42.900
<i>With the sharpness of
the piercing arrow</i>

01:43.693 --> 01:47.113
<i>The beauty of two souls united</i>

01:47.155 --> 01:49.782
<i>Wherever you go, chase you</i>

01:49.824 --> 01:51.992
<i>Whenever, chase you</i>

01:52.035 --> 01:54.037
<i>I will chase you</i>

01:54.120 --> 01:55.746
<i>Nowhere to escape</i>

01:55.830 --> 01:58.374
<i>Start running, I will chase you</i>

01:58.458 --> 02:00.501
<i>Tomorrow, chase you</i>

02:00.543 --> 02:03.254
<i>My fists will be the one
to show you</i>

02:03.463 --> 02:07.963
<i>Tenacity decides
who will win or lose</i>

02:09.177 --> 02:13.677
<i>So I chase you</i>

02:16.976 --> 02:21.313
